{
  "id": "MAT.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matthew 15",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then there come to Jesus from Jerusalem Pharisees and scribes, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why do thy disciples transgress the tradition of the elders? for they wash not their hands when they eat bread. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he answered and said unto them, Why do ye also transgress the commandment of God because of your tradition? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For God said, Honor thy father and thy mother: and, He that speaketh evil of father or mother, let him die the death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye say, Whosoever shall say to his father or his mother, That wherewith thou mightest have been profited by me is given ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall not honor his father. And ye have made void the word of God because of your tradition. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye hypocrites, well did Isaiah prophesy of you, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus went out thence, and withdrew into the parts of Tyre and Sidon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, a Canaanitish woman came out from those borders, and cried, saying, Have mercy on me, O Lord, thou son of David; my daughter is grievously vexed with a demon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he answered her not a word. And his disciples came and besought him, saying, Send her away; for she crieth after us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he answered and said, I was not sent but unto the lost sheep of the house of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But she came and worshipped him, saying, Lord, help me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he answered and said, It is not meet to take the children’s bread and cast it to the dogs. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But she said, Yea, Lord: for even the dogs eat of the crumbs which fall from their masters’ table. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus answered and said unto her, O woman, great is thy faith: be it done unto thee even as thou wilt. And her daughter was healed from that hour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus departed thence, and came nigh unto the sea of Galilee; and he went up into the mountain, and sat there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there came unto him great multitudes, having with them the lame, blind, dumb, maimed, and many others, and they cast them down at his feet; and he healed them: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "insomuch that the multitude wondered, when they saw the dumb speaking, the maimed whole, and the lame walking, and the blind seeing: and they glorified the God of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus called unto him his disciples, and said, I have compassion on the multitude, because they continue with me now three days and have nothing to eat: and I would not send them away fasting, lest haply they faint on the way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the disciples say unto him, Whence should we have so many loaves in a desert place as to fill so great a multitude? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus said unto them, How many loaves have ye? And they said, Seven, and a few small fishes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he commanded the multitude to sit down on the ground; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he took the seven loaves and the fishes; and he gave thanks and brake, and gave to the disciples, and the disciples to the multitudes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they all ate, and were filled: and they took up that which remained over of the broken pieces, seven baskets full. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they that did eat were four thousand men, besides women and children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he sent away the multitudes, and entered into the boat, and came into the borders of Magadan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
